<title>UK: UK's ITV network director Plantin to stand down.</title>
<headline>UK's ITV network director Plantin to stand down.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Plantin intends to stand down as ITV'S network director later this year, the commercial television network said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Marcus, who was appointed the ITV's first-ever network director in November 1992, will have completed five years in the position by the time of his departure, ITV said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
